<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Processo Seletivo RAITec</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/processo-seletivo.css">
</head>
<body>

  <%- include("../partials/header") -%>

  <main class="ps">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Processo Seletivo RAITec<br><%= edicao %></h1>
      <div class="countdown" data-alvo="<%= dataLimite %>" aria-label="Contagem regressiva">
        <div class="cd-item"><span id="cd-dias">00</span><small>Dias</small></div>
        <span class="cd-sep">:</span>
        <div class="cd-item"><span id="cd-horas">00</span><small>Horas</small></div>
        <span class="cd-sep">:</span>
        <div class="cd-item"><span id="cd-min">00</span><small>Minutos</small></div>
        <span class="cd-sep">:</span>
        <div class="cd-item"><span id="cd-seg">00</span><small>Segundos</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Cronograma - Etapas</h2>

      <div class="stages">

        <article class="stage">
          <div class="stage-num"><strong>01</strong><span>Inscrições</span></div>
          <p class="stage-text">TudoLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut tincidunt nibh ac magna volutpat, ut aliquam justo suscipit. Pellentesque aliquam libero cursus elit eleifend, id scelerisque tellus pretium. Nullam a sodales nunc.</p>
          <div class="stage-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/processo-seletivo/informacoes#inscricao">Informações</a>
            <button class="btn" data-resultado="1">Resultados</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stage">
          <div class="stage-num"><strong>02</strong><span>Dinâmicas</span></div>
          <p class="stage-text">TudoLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut tincidunt nibh ac magna volutpat, ut aliquam justo suscipit. Pellentesque aliquam libero cursus elit eleifend, id scelerisque tellus pretium. Nullam a sodales nunc.</p>
          <div class="stage-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/processo-seletivo/informacoes#dinamica">Informações</a>
            <button class="btn" data-resultado="2">Resultados</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stage">
          <div class="stage-num"><strong>03</strong><span>Entrevistas</span></div>
          <p class="stage-text">TudoLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut tincidunt nibh ac magna volutpat, ut aliquam justo suscipit. Pellentesque aliquam libero cursus elit eleifend, id scelerisque tellus pretium. Nullam a sodales nunc.</p>
          <div class="stage-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/processo-seletivo/informacoes#entrevista">Informações</a>
            <button class="btn" data-resultado="3">Resultados</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stage">
          <div class="stage-num"><strong>04</strong><span>Trainee</span></div>
          <p class="stage-text">TudoLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut tincidunt nibh ac magna volutpat, ut aliquam justo suscipit. Pellentesque aliquam libero cursus elit eleifend, id scelerisque tellus pretium. Nullam a sodales nunc.</p>
          <div class="stage-actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/processo-seletivo/informacoes#trainee">Informações</a>
            <button class="btn" data-resultado="4">Resultados</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="stage">
          <div class="stage-num"><strong>05</strong><span>Resultado Final</span></div>
          <p class="stage-text">TudoLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut tincidunt nibh ac magna volutpat, ut aliquam justo suscipit. Pellentesque aliquam libero cursus elit eleifend, id scelerisque tellus pretium. Nullam a sodales nunc.</p>
